# Flutter-related
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Pods/

# Xcode-related
**/dgph
**/xcuserdata/

# Xcode build output and local state. A failed macOS build leaves a lot of
# this behind, and it is all regenerated — never commit any of it.
**/DerivedData/
**/build/
**/ephemeral/
**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/xcshareddata/WorkspaceSettings.xcsettings
**/xcshareddata/IDEWorkspaceChecks.plist
*.xcresult
*.moved-aside
*.pbxuser
!default.pbxuser

# CocoaPods: Podfile and Podfile.lock ARE committed (they pin pod versions);
# the installed pods and the generated resources are not.
Podfile.lock.bak
**/Pods/
